{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A member a program adds lands on the nearest thing that lives on (decision 564): a variable's own value keeps it,\nbut a plain value inside another value (the number under %d.t%) has nowhere to keep one. That write is an error\nunder its own key — never a silent success, never a crash.",
